 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "Which service does reporting depend on now?\n[2025-09-19] standup/boreal/2025-09-19: We decided that reporting will read from the event-bus instead of querying the ledger directly. The reason: the nightly ledger scans were blocking billing runs. That removes the dependency on Ledger from the reporting service. [2025-11-13] standup/boreal/2025-11-13: The reporting service still relies on the bus; keep that in mind for the maintenance. [2025-02-06] standup/dune/2025-02-06: If the ledger service is down, the reports pipeline is down: it relies on it for the nightly balance export.",
  "dimensions": 1536
